ata-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Photos &amp; Video</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"bd-menu__link\" href=\"/sign-in\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign in</span></span></a></li></ul></div></div></dialog></div></nav><p class=\"bd-masthead__motto\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"bd-masthead__rule\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-script\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Love, peace &amp; happiness</span></span></p></div></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"bd-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Sara + Tyler\"><section class=\"bd-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Sara + Tyler\"><div class=\"bd-hero__media\"><picture data-media=\"couple.hero.formal\" data-interim=\"true\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22800%22%20height%3D%22588%22%2F%3E\" width=\"745\" height=\"407\" alt=\"Generated portrait of Sara and Tyler cheek to cheek on a bridge over the Chicago River, the towers of downtown glowing behind them.\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\" fetchpriority=\"high\" style=\"object-position:46% 40%\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture></div><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--hero-left\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/corner-tl-138.webp\" width=\"138\" height=\"278\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.corner-tl\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><div class=\"bd-hero__copy\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow bd-hero__kicker\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Join us for our wedding</span></p><h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"bd-hero__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Sara</span><span class=\"bd-plus\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\"> + </span></span><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Tyler</span></h1><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-hero__date\"><time datetime=\"2027-07-17\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027</span></time></p><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-hero__place\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago, Illinois</span></span></p><div class=\"bd-hero__actions\"><a class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--primary\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--secondary\" href=\"/explore-caa\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Explore the building</span></span></a></div><p class=\"bd-hero__lede\"><span class=\"bd-hero__status\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are getting married</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are inviting the people we love into the places, adventures, and memories that made us. Details as they are settled.</span></span></p></div><div class=\"bd-hero__count\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p class=\"bd-countdown bd-countdown--hero\"><span class=\"bd-countdown__num\" style=\"--bd-days:297\"><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">297</span></span><span class=\"bd-countdown__digits\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span> <span class=\"bd-countdown__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">days to go</span></span></p><p class=\"bd-hero__theme\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love, peace &amp; happiness</span></p></div></section><section class=\"bd-theme\" aria-labelledby=\"theme-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Love, peace &amp; happiness\"><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--theme\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/edge-left-tall-88.webp\" width=\"88\" height=\"326\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.edge-left-tall\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><div class=\"bd-theme__inner\"><div class=\"bd-theme__intro\"><h2 class=\"bd-h bd-h--2 bd-theme__title\" id=\"theme-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Love, peace </span><br><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">&amp; happiness</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We have been lucky. A city we love, adventures that changed us, and people who made every one of them better.</span><!-- --> <!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Not everyone we love has been able to share them with us yet, so on Saturday, July 17, 2027, we are bringing you along to Chicago.</span></p></div><ol class=\"bd-theme__list\"><li class=\"bd-theme__item\" data-reveal=\"\"><h3 class=\"bd-theme__word\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Love</span></h3><span class=\"bd-theme__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Every one of you is part of how we got here. This weekend is as much about you as it is about us.</span></p></li><li class=\"bd-theme__item\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-b=\"\"><h3 class=\"bd-theme__word\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Peace</span></h3><span class=\"bd-theme__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No rush and no guesswork: a weekend to slow down, catch up and simply be together. Everything practical is on this site as it is settled, so you can come relaxed.</span></p></li><li class=\"bd-theme__item\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-b=\"\"><h3 class=\"bd-theme__word\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Happiness</span></h3><span class=\"bd-theme__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The places that made us happy, shared with you: the river and its bridges, the lakefront, a Venetian Gothic landmark on Michigan Avenue. Then dinner, toasts and dancing.</span></p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"bd-share\" aria-labelledby=\"share-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What we can’t wait to share\"><header class=\"bd-share__head\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"What we can’t wait to share\"><h2 class=\"bd-h bd-h--2 bd-share__title\" id=\"share-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What we can’t wait to share</span></h2></header><article class=\"bd-share__item bd-share__item--story\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How it all started\"><figure class=\"bd-share__photo\" data-reveal=\"photo\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture data-media=\"couple.story.monochrome\" data-interim=\"true\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22610%22%20height%3D%22436%22%2F%3E\" width=\"301\" height=\"216\" alt=\"Generated black-and-white portrait: Sara looking up at Tyler, both smiling.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:55% 40%\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture></figure><div class=\"bd-share__body\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our story</span></p><h3 class=\"bd-share__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How it all started</span></h3><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">At Allison and Jamie’s wedding: flirty glances across the room, and a connection that was immediate. Weddings have been good to us; we hope this one is good to you.</span></p><a class=\"bd-more\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Read our story</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"bd-share__item bd-share__item--venue\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Chicago Athletic Association\"><figure class=\"bd-share__photo\" data-reveal=\"photo\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture data-media=\"venue.exterior\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22610%22%20height%3D%22508%22%2F%3E\" width=\"1513\" height=\"1260\" alt=\"The Chicago Athletic Association building on Michigan Avenue: red brick and pale stone, tiers of pointed Venetian Gothic windows above the street.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 45%\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture></figure><div class=\"bd-share__body\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The venue</span></p><h3 class=\"bd-share__name bd-italic\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Chicago Athletic Association</span></h3><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Venetian Gothic on Michigan Avenue since 1893, restored as a hotel. </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Where we will say “I do.”</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> Carved limestone, stained glass, marble floors, and Millennium Park out the windows.</span></p><a class=\"bd-more\" href=\"/explore-caa\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Explore the venue</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"bd-share__item bd-share__item--city\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"A city we love\"><figure class=\"bd-share__photo\" data-reveal=\"photo\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture data-media=\"city.skyline\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221434%22%20height%3D%22168%22%2F%3E\" width=\"3840\" height=\"986\" alt=\"The Chicago skyline across the lake at dusk, seen from the Adler Planetarium.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 60%\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture></figure><div class=\"bd-share__body bd-share__body--plate\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore Chicago</span></p><h3 class=\"bd-share__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">A city we love</span></h3><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The river and its bridges, North Pond, the lakefront by the Adler: a few of our favorite places, and how to reach them from the hotel.</span></p><a class=\"bd-more\" href=\"/share-an-adventure\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Get our guide</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></div></article></section><section class=\"bd-band\" aria-labelledby=\"schedule-title\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"A weekend to remember\"><div class=\"bd-schedule\"><span class=\"bd-decoframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M32 1L63 20V220L32 239L1 220V20Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path><path d=\"M32 9L56 24V216L32 231L8 216V24Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg><span class=\"bd-monogram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"bd-monogram__s\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">S</span></span><span class=\"bd-monogram__stem\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-monogram__t\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">T</span></span></span></span><div class=\"bd-schedule__intro\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Wedding weekend</span></p><h2 class=\"bd-h bd-h--2 bd-schedule__title\" id=\"schedule-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">A weekend </span><br><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">to remember</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">A ceremony, dinner, toasts and dancing, all on one Saturday.</span></p><a class=\"bd-more\" href=\"/the-wedding\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">See the full schedule</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bd-schedule__day-block\"><time class=\"bd-schedule__day\" datetime=\"2027-07-17\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sat</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Jul</span><!-- --> <!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"label\">17</span></span></time><ol class=\"bd-schedule__list\" aria-label=\"Saturday, July 17, 2027, in order\"><li class=\"bd-schedule__row\"><span class=\"bd-schedule__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ceremony</span></span><span class=\"bd-schedule__note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Indoors, at the hotel</span></span></li><li class=\"bd-schedule__row\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-schedule__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Cocktail hour</span></span><span class=\"bd-schedule__note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Between the two</span></span></li><li class=\"bd-schedule__row\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-schedule__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Reception</span></span><span class=\"bd-schedule__note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Dinner, toasts, dancing</span></span></li></ol></div><p class=\"bd-schedule__todo\"><span class=\"placeholder placeholder--inline\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <span class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the times and the rooms.</span></span></span></p></div></section><section class=\"bd-closing\" aria-labelledby=\"closing-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Our memories, and yours to come\"><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--closing\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/cluster-tl-152.webp\" width=\"152\" height=\"232\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.cluster-tl\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><div class=\"bd-closing__text\" data-reveal=\"\" data-reveal-state=\"in\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Gallery</span></p><h2 class=\"bd-h bd-h--2 bd-closing__title\" id=\"closing-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our memories, </span><br><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">and yours to come</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photographs from our adventures will gather here, and after the weekend the ones from it will too, yours included.</span></p><a class=\"bd-more\" href=\"/photos\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Visit the gallery</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a><p class=\"bd-script bd-closing__sign\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">See you in Chicago</span></p></div></section></main><nav class=\"bd-bar\" aria-label=\"Quick actions\" style=\"--cells:3\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Quick actions\"><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentCol